  "description": "Towing mirrors are specifically designed for towing trailers.YITAMOTOR Towing mirrors extend outward further than the standard truck mirrors, increasing your rearward vision to help provide a safer towing experience. We offer manual and power-adjustable, extendable telescoping towing mirrors to maximize visibility, and available with the heating feature to eliminate frost. We also have towing mirrors with LED lights that synchronize to your turn signals.\nFitments\n2007 - 2013 Chevy Silverado 1500 Models Only\n2007 - 2013 GMC Sierra 1500 Models Only\n2008 - 2014 Chevy Silverado 2500 / 3500 Models Only\n2008 - 2014 GMC Sierra 2500 / 3500 Models Only\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nFITMENT - Compatible with Chevy Silverado GMC Sierra 2007 - 2013 all models (Just 2007 New Body Style), 2007 - 2013 Compatible with Chevy Tahoe / Suburban / Avalanche, 2007-2013 GMC Yukon/Yukon XL/Yukon Denali, 2014 Compatible with Chevy Silverado 2500HD 3500HD (Heavy Duty Models Only) (Not fit models with power fold / memory functions)\nMULTIFUNCTION - Power Adjusted Glass, Heated (Works with the rear defrost like the original), Manual Folding, Manual Telescoping (From 19 inch to 22 inch)\nIMPORTANT NOTE - This mirror is designed to replace an original mirror with these exact options. If you do not have the options listed, there is a possibility that this mirror may not function properly (Not fit models with power fold / memory functions)\nUPGRADED MIRRORS - The towing mirrors provide better and wider angle of rear view, improves visibility and reduces blind spot. Upgrades on road safety. Easy install\nWHAT YOU GET - A Pair of towing mirrors (Include left side and right side) .\nProfessional installation is highly recommended",
